<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Elevate USF&rsquo;s status as a top-tier institution in AI and Cybersecurity research by recruiting world-class faculty and building an agile, resilient, and ambitious collaborative research culture.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td>
<table class="media-large">
<thead>
<tr>
